WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:12.846
This film is about amazing architecture.

2
00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:15.682
My favourite building is the Centre Pompidou.

3
00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:17.584
It’s an art gallery in Paris.

4
00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:22.856
I find it interesting because the inside of the building is on the outside.

5
00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:27.160
If you could choose one building that you’d say is your favourite, what is your favourite building?

6
00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:30.497
Even though I like old buildings, I’d say I like the Tate Modern

7
00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:34.167
because of its wide rooms so it’s quite good to display art there.

8
00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.736
I think probably the Colosseum in Rome

9
00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:41.641
because it’s got a unique shape and we just don’t build buildings like that anymore.

10
00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:45.311
So do you prefer old buildings or modern buildings?

11
00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:50.383
I like old buildings because they’re all unique and they have a lot of tradition behind them.

12
00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:54.187
There’s always something special about them that’s not like buildings made today.

13
00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:58.558
I think I like old buildings more because they’ve something more to say about them.

14
00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:04.264
Why do you think it’s important to have local facilities such as parks or shops near your home?

15
00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:08.301
It helps me if they’re really easy to get to because that way, 

16
00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:12.705
I can meet my friends really easily and I don’t need to drive there which would take a long time.

17
00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:16.810
I think it’s more convenient so you don’t have to travel as far and I think with parks, 

18
00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:19.646
it’s good because it encourages people to go outside, go for walks.
